#: scenario2:scenario2_AF534BF7_1E63_4858_9822_AE827236AD2A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69d3ffe36087b8287960ce62d98829bd67f17618392b6c80aed593fc8d194cef
#. default-sha256: f7f3e4bef0368a5c6b9f1085055eec18a666a1fded830a530bba1b9867115d42
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_AF534BF7_1E63_4858_9822_AE827236AD2A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite all the effort he had put into learning to act like a human,⟪k:1⟫he now ripped the "
"velvet curtains off the wall, howling shrilly..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫힘들게 사람다워졌건만, ⟪k:1⟫짐승으로 돌아간 베스티아는 ⟪k:2⟫벨벳 커튼을 찢다가 ⟪k:3⟫신음했"
"고……"

#: scenario2:scenario2_BA98E10A_4FFE_4B82_BC86_489544991836
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 895d02c4a50fb5f2db45e88134faaef4c8e62170b799eb13902f0239b563978e
#. default-sha256: 74701902600ee45dd502d9cdf83d2be99c72eb9463b9aa3271960ac69e69b344
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BA98E10A_4FFE_4B82_BC86_489544991836"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫stomping back and forth through the hallways,⟪k:1⟫and ravaging the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫복도를 쿵쿵거리며 오가다가 ⟪k:1⟫정원에 마구 행패를 부렸습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6C475E70_A81C_4BFD_ABE3_D949B020BD8D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 84377ccc972fe12aae61bffa124cdb7541d07dc15a973cb4d1024dc9a5edd114
