msgid "⟪k:0⟫I watched him intently, though from a distance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저는 ⟪k:1⟫그러는 걸 멀찍이서 바라보았습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_76DF26B7_C79C_43E6_ABEE_EA8D8BD55483
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ec877e3362a7740749bca99faf08e9bcb7700017f75e5df0647923d3c0ac4f2
#. default-sha256: e3ea6c09cd53094e52b7209c6ed2d577a25ed955522b110c8bd97e8a5b5dd97d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_76DF26B7_C79C_43E6_ABEE_EA8D8BD55483"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Bestia was not merely a beast,⟪k:1⟫but an out-of-control, bloodthirsty beast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫베스티아는 이때 ⟪k:1⟫한낱 짐승이 아니었습니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫감당이 안 될 만큼 ⟪k:4⟫피에 주린 짐"
"승 같았지요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_BB3EA482_6936_4D0F_A580_E91CE2D177F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58f26c67013241e94179098fa77ca291fe6f30dc28f7c0912d22f79e10db6174
#. default-sha256: be0e23e97c3fc68dc8d27b8819cefdc9c90c099d3af360d2d4c6bac318a2f18a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BB3EA482_6936_4D0F_A580_E91CE2D177F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Just a few days ago, we had been tending the garden together,⟪k:1⟫but that was no longer "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫얼마 전까지만 해도 ⟪k:1⟫베스티아와 함께 정원도 정돈할 수 있었는데, ⟪k:2⟫그것도 불가능해졌습니"
"다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F3463257_B8F0_4A65_9B30_63C2DAA67D32
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed799ed9c8dc483001706d31862fb825e16e915bc7a6746f3fad53040822c5a4
