#: scenario2:scenario2_BD734C9A_6BE8_4DF1_A1F8_9420881B20A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6d6f114f00f7ec13fba9a7dbda38fbda767d27af6329170cedb67b5be79b261
