msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫평온으로는 ⟪k:2⟫당신을 충족시킬 수 없었는지요?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_74DDD056_1D04_48D8_ABCF_32277ECC01DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3aac8677ef9de827babafc7affe8b1c1964a85fa4405a74b2c93e7cd353370bf
