msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was mistaken...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Asking for peace won’t solve anything!⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫나는 착각을 했다……, ⟪k:2⟫그딴 걸 바란들 ⟪k:3⟫아무 해결도 안 돼!⟪k:4⟫"

#: scenario2:scenario2_2FB5527E_7BE5_42EC_856F_6A709DB470D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18935799ff3e8db3067a80fc346408e8e5654678f7444b68fe196f215e3fd6e7
