msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2FB5527E_7BE5_42EC_856F_6A709DB470D9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Blood! Despair! Eyes filled with terror!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫These⟪k:4⟫ are the things I need!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫피! ⟪k:1⟫절망! ⟪k:2⟫나를 보고 공포에 떠는 두 눈……!!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫내겐 그게 필요해……!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7BEAD8C7_5402_4EAA_B237_D81D80A53B63
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f077c9ea4fefd19122154c54610c437048252d6f3449b57150685fef1ea31ffc
#. default-sha256: 05076c1b3ec74477045550f77605a8fc33b8a7e88e9976dc025eb8817adeb89a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7BEAD8C7_5402_4EAA_B237_D81D80A53B63"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I’ve always known it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫처음부터 알고 있었어……!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_042BD0C6_56E9_4935_A39D_6D2E017DDBF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3310ab106eecd3948bd86b8682db75ceccda30a81ad040d60e3c1883a23e0e04
#. default-sha256: 9555655f29e1750186369997a68d0848f20efffbc4667b732758906d4621f7ff
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_042BD0C6_56E9_4935_A39D_6D2E017DDBF0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You said this mansion fulfills people’s desires!⟪k:1⟫Then... ⟪k:2⟫Then..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이 저택은 내 소망을 이루어 준다고 했지!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그렇다면, ⟪k:3⟫그렇다면……"

#: scenario2:scenario2_ABAFA661_B50D_44A5_A9CC_F2392825F410
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f6c79bde64a37a6eaa9ecce0b1ad09c69a5663a85e3f44d496a12828d924ba53
#. default-sha256: f960ec56146f59c23096c64355a07e148b55f8b688187bf8c0076ffcc301dc9a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ABAFA661_B50D_44A5_A9CC_F2392825F410"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Give me prey!⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫No more hares—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫live "
"humans⟪k:12⟫!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫―――내게 사냥감을 내놔! ⟪k:5⟫멧토끼 말고, ⟪k:6⟫살아 있는 인간을!!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_36216E4E_37A8_4288_9365_AC3C7D3298A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 014f8dc2f23bf05115fa99933779cf885073ab3b9cb96dd42461a68951d87f35
