msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though something ⟪k:1⟫felt⟪k:2⟫ suspicious about the man who greeted them at the door, on "
"the surface, he looked like a proper nobleman..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫이들은 ⟪k:1⟫환대하는 저택 주인에게 의심을 품었으나, ⟪k:2⟫모습만큼은 귀족처럼 보였기에……."

#: scenario2:scenario2_3E8FE2B7_C8DC_484A_A0D9_C9F7D095F49F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
